   "source": [
    "### 5.3 Text Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "A standard cleaning pipeline is applied to both the title and the body:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Strip HTML tags, URLs, digits, and punctuation\n",
    "- Lowercase\n",
    "- Tokenize, remove English stopwords, and apply Porter stemming\n",
    "- Collapse repeated whitespace and repeated characters"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "807d29c0",
   "metadata": {
