      "Epoch 07 | train 0.0746/0.9750 | val 0.1425/0.9481 | test 0.1469/0.9488\n",
      "Epoch 08 | train 0.0629/0.9797 | val 0.1395/0.9499 | test 0.1424/0.9471\n",
      "Epoch 09 | train 0.0480/0.9853 | val 0.1493/0.9529 | test 0.1488/0.9510\n",
      "Early stopping at epoch 9 (no val improvement for 3 epochs).\n",
      "Restored best LSTM weights (val loss 0.1300).\n"
     ]
