      "Confident Fake   idx= 12563  P(Fake)=1.000  true=Fake\n",
      "Confident Real   idx= 11413  P(Fake)=0.000  true=Real\n",
      "Confident Error  idx=  1871  P(Fake)=0.002  true=Fake\n"
     ]
    },
    {
